            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWith blessings from the original author we have taken the ValidationAttributes package for Umbraco and forked it into a repo under the Umbraco Community GitHub account.\n\nI have released a stable for V17 that can be download now!\n\nhttps://marketplace.umbraco.com/package/umbraco.community.validationattributes\n\n#umbraco #community\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://discord.com/channels/869656431308189746/882981290662580264/1479418096111583373\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
